{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Name: Plane War</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of players: Single player mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game introduction: The battlefield is on a vast sea level, under the blue sky. Players operate a fighter jet, which continuously fires bullets to eliminate enemy fighter jets approaching from the front. If you persist long enough, you will see the boss fighter jet, which is a huge aircraft with thick blood stripes. It fires three bullets at a time and uses flexible positioning to eliminate them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the direction of the fighter jet through the \u2191\u2193\u2190 \u2192 on the keyboard, flexibly avoid bullets and fighter jets. When touched by enemy aircraft or bullets, the PH value will decrease. The initial PH value is 100. Eliminating the fighter jet can increase the score. Record the score in the upper left corner, and the higher the score, the more powerful you are!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083170/extras/29f9bfc94e4fb2c9f75e8aad8760b47e.avif?t=1761116599\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083170?t=1761116599","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083170?t=1761116599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083170/903adaa1af26bc03d0ac6df5782641690c182031/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761116599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083170/903adaa1af26bc03d0ac6df5782641690c182031/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761116599","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Name: Plane War</p><p